OL,3,A'We couldn't give up that easily':
OL,4,AMarching bands scramble to cover costs
OL,5,Aafter Thanksgiving parade rearranged
OL,6,
OL,7,FDemkovich and his Pearland High School
OL,8,Fband made the quick decision to launch
OL,9,Fa fundraiser, reaching $350,000
OL,10,F(#267,000) in just a few hours.
OL,12,FStill, some performers reportedly had
OL,13,Fto skip the parade, a televised,
OL,14,Ftraditional Thanksgiving event - now
OL,15,Frescheduled for Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
